<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>WFWorkflowActions</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.comment</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>📋 番茄钟</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.comment</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>• • 25分钟专注计时</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.comment</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>• • 5分钟休息提醒</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.comment</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>• • 4个番茄后长休息15分钟</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.comment</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>在快捷指令 App 中手动创建此快捷指令，按上述步骤添加操作。</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.showresult</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFTextActionText</key>
				<string>✅ 快捷指令设计完成！

请在快捷指令 App 中手动创建：
1. 打开「快捷指令」App
2. 点击 + 新建快捷指令
3. 按上方步骤逐一添加操作
4. 完成后命名保存</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.gettext</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFTextActionText</key>
				<string>🍅 番茄钟开始！

专注 25 分钟
然后休息 5 分钟</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.sleep</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFSleepDuration</key>
				<real>1500.0</real>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.displaynotification</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFNotificationActionBody</key>
				<string>专注时间结束，该休息一下了</string>
				<key>WFNotificationActionSubtitle</key>
				<string>休息 5 分钟</string>
				<key>WFNotificationActionTitle</key>
				<string>🍅 番茄时间到！</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.showresult</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFTextActionText</key>
				<string></string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
